0"><span begin="00:43.171" end="00:43.522">Please </span><span begin="00:43.522" end="00:43.873">don't </span><span begin="00:43.873" end="00:44.242">you </span><span begin="00:44.242" end="00:45.490">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.277" end="00:48.641"><span begin="00:46.277" end="00:46.623">I'll </span><span begin="00:46.623" end="00:46.952">be </span><span begin="00:46.952" end="00:48.641">alone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.327" end="00:52.038"><span begin="00:49.327" end="00:49.684">Wait </span><span begin="00:49.684" end="00:50.399">until </span><span begin="00:50.399" end="00:50.752">the </span><span begin="00:50.752" end="00:52.038">morning</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.413" end="00:55.334"><span begin="00:52.413" end="00:52.753">Ride </span><span begin="00:52.753" end="00:53.465">until </span><span begin="00:53.465" end="00:53.822">it's </span><span begin="00:53.822" end="00:55.334">dawning</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.741" end="01:25.643"><span begin="01:21.741" end="01:22.086">Come </span><span begin="01:22.086" end="01:22.416">and </span><span begin="01:22.416" end="01:22.777">ride </span><span begin="01:22.777" end="01:23.125">with </span><span begin="01:23.125" end="01:23.564">me </span><span begin="01:23.564" end="01:25.643">tonight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.857" end="01:32.707"><span begin="01:27.857" end="01:28.177">Come </span><span begin="01:28.177" end="01:28.509">and </span><span begin="01:28.509" end="01:28.924">ride </span><span begin="01:28.924" end="01:29.274">with </span><span begin="01:29.274" end="01:29.699">me </span><span begin="01:29.699" end="01:32.707">tonight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.988" end="01:34.752"><span begin="01:32.988" end="01:33.242">It's </span><span begin="01:33.242" end="01:33.485">closer </span><span begin="01:33.485" end="01:33.713">to </span><span begin="01:33.713" end="01:34.752">midnight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.569" end="0