span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.724" end="01:56.409"><span begin="01:54.724" end="01:55.044">Baby </span><span begin="01:55.044" end="01:55.412">I'm </span><span begin="01:55.412" end="01:55.829">all </span><span begin="01:55.829" end="01:56.082">for </span><span begin="01:56.082" end="01:56.409">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.409" end="02:00.599"><span begin="01:56.409" end="01:56.985">I </span><span begin="01:56.985" end="01:57.835">know </span><span begin="01:57.835" end="01:58.388">I'm </span><span begin="01:58.388" end="01:58.647">the </span><span begin="01:58.647" end="01:59.199">lucky </span><span begin="01:59.199" end="02:00.599">one</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.959" end="02:09.101"><span begin="02:00.959" end="02:01.565">Wonder </span><span begin="02:01.565" end="02:02.058">what </span><span begin="02:02.058" end="02:02.328">I've </span><span begin="02:02.328" end="02:03.566">done </span><span begin="02:03.996" end="02:04.373">to </span><span begin="02:04.373" end="02:06.040">deserve </span><span begin="02:06.040" end="02:09.101">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.048" end="02:15.372"><span begin="02:11.048" end="02:11.352">Come </span><span begin="02:11.352" end="02:11.654">and </span><span begin="02:11.654" end="02:11.988">ride </span><span begin="02:11.988" end="02:12.327">with </span><span begin="02:12.327" end="02:12.743">me </span><span begin="02:12.743" end="02:15.372">tonight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.718" end="02:17.940"><span begin="02:15.718" end="02:16.008">Please </span><span begin="02:16.008" end="02:16.304">don't </span><span begin="02:16.304" end="02:16.640">you </span><span begin="02:16.640" end="02:17.940">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.623" end="02:21.078"><span begin="02:18.623" end="02:18.934">I'll </span><span begin="02:18.934" end="02:19.265">be </span><span begin="02:19.265" end="02:21.078">alone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.666" end="02:24.415"><span